{"n":80,"name":"'Abasa","nameAr":"عبس","meaning":"He Frowned","ayahs":42,"place":"makkah","bismillah":true,"ayat":[{"n":1,"juz":30,"ar":"عَبَسَ وَتَوَلَّىٰٓ","en":"He [i.e., the Prophet (ﷺ) ] frowned and turned away","w":[{"ar":"عَبَسَ","tr":"ʿabasa","en":"He frowned","root":"عبس","lem":"عَبَسَ"},{"ar":"وَتَوَلَّىٰٓ","tr":"watawallā","en":"and turned away","root":"ولي","lem":"تَوَلَّى"}]},{"n":2,"juz":30,"ar":"أَن جَآءَهُ ٱلْأَعْمَىٰ","en":"Because there came to him the blind man, [interrupting].","w":[{"ar":"أَن","tr":"an","en":"Because"},{"ar":"جَآءَهُ","tr":"jāahu","en":"came to him","root":"جيأ","lem":"جاءَ"},{"ar":"ٱلْأَعْمَىٰ","tr":"l-aʿmā","en":"the blind man","root":"عمي","lem":"أَعْمَى"}]},{"n":3,"juz":30,"ar":"وَمَا يُدْرِيكَ لَعَلَّهُۥ يَزَّكَّىٰٓ","en":"But what would make you perceive, [O Muḥammad], that perhaps he might be purified","w":[{"ar":"وَمَا","tr":"wamā","en":"But what"},{"ar":"يُدْرِيكَ","tr":"yud'rīka","en":"would make you know","root":"دري","lem":"أَدْرَى"},{"ar":"لَعَلَّهُۥ","tr":"laʿallahu","en":"that he might"},{"ar":"يَزَّكَّىٰٓ","tr":"yazzakkā","en":"purify himself","root":"زكو","lem":"تَزَكَّى"}]},{"n":4,"juz":30,"ar":"أَوْ يَذَّكَّرُ فَتَنفَعَهُ ٱلذِّكْرَىٰٓ","en":"Or be reminded and the remembrance would benefit him?","w":[{"ar":"أَوْ","tr":"aw","en":"Or"},{"ar":"يَذَّكَّرُ","tr":"yadhakkaru","en":"be reminded","root":"ذكر","lem":"تَذَكَّرَ"},{"ar":"فَتَنفَعَهُ","tr":"fatanfaʿahu","en":"so would benefit him","root":"نفع","lem":"نَفَعَ"},{"ar":"ٱلذِّكْرَىٰٓ","tr":"l-dhik'rā","en":"the reminder","root":"ذكر","lem":"ذِكْرَى"}]},{"n":5,"juz":30,"ar":"أَمَّا مَنِ ٱسْتَغْنَىٰ","en":"As for he who thinks himself without need,","w":[{"ar":"أَمَّا","tr":"ammā","en":"As for"},{"ar":"مَنِ","tr":"mani","en":"(him) who"},{"ar":"ٱسْتَغْنَىٰ","tr":"is'taghnā","en":"considers himself free from need","root":"غني","lem":"اسْتَغْنَى"}]},{"n":6,"juz":30,"ar":"فَأَنتَ لَهُۥ تَصَدَّىٰ","en":"To him you give attention.","w":[{"ar":"فَأَنتَ","tr":"fa-anta","en":"So you"},{"ar":"لَهُۥ","tr":"lahu","en":"to him"},{"ar":"تَصَدَّىٰ","tr":"taṣaddā","en":"give attention","root":"صدي","lem":"تَصَدَّى"}]},{"n":7,"juz":30,"ar":"وَمَا عَلَيْكَ أَلَّا يَزَّكَّىٰ","en":"And not upon you [is any blame] if he will not be purified.","w":[{"ar":"وَمَا","tr":"wamā","en":"And not"},{"ar":"عَلَيْكَ","tr":"ʿalayka","en":"upon you"},{"ar":"أَلَّا","tr":"allā","en":"that not"},{"ar":"يَزَّكَّىٰ","tr":"yazzakkā","en":"he purifies himself","root":"زكو","lem":"تَزَكَّى"}]},{"n":8,"juz":30,"ar":"وَأَمَّا مَن جَآءَكَ يَسْعَىٰ","en":"But as for he who came to you striving [for knowledge]","w":[{"ar":"وَأَمَّا","tr":"wa-ammā","en":"But as for"},{"ar":"مَن","tr":"man","en":"(he) who"},{"ar":"جَآءَكَ","tr":"jāaka","en":"came to you","root":"جيأ","lem":"جاءَ"},{"ar":"يَسْعَىٰ","tr":"yasʿā","en":"striving","root":"سعي","lem":"سَعَى"}]},{"n":9,"juz":30,"ar":"وَهُوَ يَخْشَىٰ","en":"While he fears [Allāh],","w":[{"ar":"وَهُوَ","tr":"wahuwa","en":"While he"},{"ar":"يَخْشَىٰ","tr":"yakhshā","en":"fears","root":"خشي","lem":"خَشِيَ"}]},{"n":10,"juz":30,"ar":"فَأَنتَ عَنْهُ تَلَهَّىٰ","en":"From him you are distracted.","w":[{"ar":"فَأَنتَ","tr":"fa-anta","en":"But you"},{"ar":"عَنْهُ","tr":"ʿanhu","en":"from him"},{"ar":"تَلَهَّىٰ","tr":"talahhā","en":"(are) distracted","root":"لهو","lem":"تَلَهَّى"}]},{"n":11,"juz":30,"ar":"كَلَّآ إِنَّهَا تَذْكِرَةٌ","en":"No! Indeed, they [i.e., these verses] are a reminder;","w":[{"ar":"كَلَّآ","tr":"kallā","en":"Nay"},{"ar":"إِنَّهَا","tr":"innahā","en":"Indeed, it"},{"ar":"تَذْكِرَةٌۭ","tr":"tadhkiratun","en":"(is) a reminder","root":"ذكر","lem":"تَذْكِرَة"}]},{"n":12,"juz":30,"ar":"فَمَن شَآءَ ذَكَرَهُۥ","en":"So whoever wills may remember it.","w":[{"ar":"فَمَن","tr":"faman","en":"So whosoever"},{"ar":"شَآءَ","tr":"shāa","en":"wills","root":"شيأ","lem":"شاءَ"},{"ar":"ذَكَرَهُۥ","tr":"dhakarahu","en":"may remember it","root":"ذكر","lem":"ذَكَرَ"}]},{"n":13,"juz":30,"ar":"فِى صُحُفٍ مُّكَرَّمَةٍ","en":"[It is recorded] in honored sheets,","w":[{"ar":"فِى","tr":"fī","en":"In"},{"ar":"صُحُفٍۢ","tr":"ṣuḥufin","en":"sheets","root":"صحف","lem":"صُحُف"},{"ar":"مُّكَرَّمَةٍۢ","tr":"mukarramatin","en":"honored","root":"كرم","lem":"مُكَرَّمَة"}]},{"n":14,"juz":30,"ar":"مَّرْفُوعَةٍ مُّطَهَّرَةٍۭ","en":"Exalted and purified,","w":[{"ar":"مَّرْفُوعَةٍۢ","tr":"marfūʿatin","en":"Exalted","root":"رفع","lem":"مَرْفُوعَة"},{"ar":"مُّطَهَّرَةٍۭ","tr":"muṭahharatin","en":"purified","root":"طهر","lem":"مُطَهَّرَة"}]},{"n":15,"juz":30,"ar":"بِأَيْدِى سَفَرَةٍ","en":"[Carried] by the hands of messenger-angels,","w":[{"ar":"بِأَيْدِى","tr":"bi-aydī","en":"In (the) hands","root":"يدي","lem":"يَد"},{"ar":"سَفَرَةٍۢ","tr":"safaratin","en":"(of) scribes","root":"سفر","lem":"سَفَرَة"}]},{"n":16,"juz":30,"ar":"كِرَامٍۭ بَرَرَةٍ","en":"Noble and dutiful.","w":[{"ar":"كِرَامٍۭ","tr":"kirāmin","en":"Noble","root":"كرم","lem":"كَرِيم"},{"ar":"بَرَرَةٍۢ","tr":"bararatin","en":"dutiful","root":"برر","lem":"بَرّ"}]},{"n":17,"juz":30,"ar":"قُتِلَ ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ مَآ أَكْفَرَهُۥ","en":"Destroyed [i.e., cursed] is man; how disbelieving is he.","w":[{"ar":"قُتِلَ","tr":"qutila","en":"Is destroyed","root":"قتل","lem":"قَتَلَ"},{"ar":"ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ","tr":"l-insānu","en":"[the] man","root":"أنس","lem":"إِنسان"},{"ar":"مَآ","tr":"mā","en":"how"},{"ar":"أَكْفَرَهُۥ","tr":"akfarahu","en":"ungrateful is he","root":"كفر","lem":"أَكْفَرَ"}]},{"n":18,"juz":30,"ar":"مِنْ أَىِّ شَىْءٍ خَلَقَهُۥ","en":"From what thing [i.e., substance] did He create him?","w":[{"ar":"مِنْ","tr":"min","en":"From"},{"ar":"أَىِّ","tr":"ayyi","en":"what","root":"أيي","lem":"أَيّ"},{"ar":"شَىْءٍ","tr":"shayin","en":"thing","root":"شيأ","lem":"شَىْء"},{"ar":"خَلَقَهُۥ","tr":"khalaqahu","en":"He created him","root":"خلق","lem":"خَلَقَ"}]},{"n":19,"juz":30,"ar":"مِن نُّطْفَةٍ خَلَقَهُۥ فَقَدَّرَهُۥ","en":"From a sperm-drop He created him and destined for him;","w":[{"ar":"مِن","tr":"min","en":"From"},{"ar":"نُّطْفَةٍ","tr":"nuṭ'fatin","en":"a semen-drop","root":"نطف","lem":"نُطْفَة"},{"ar":"خَلَقَهُۥ","tr":"khalaqahu","en":"He created him","root":"خلق","lem":"خَلَقَ"},{"ar":"فَقَدَّرَهُۥ","tr":"faqaddarahu","en":"then He proportioned him","root":"قدر","lem":"قَدَّرَ"}]},{"n":20,"juz":30,"ar":"ثُمَّ ٱلسَّبِيلَ يَسَّرَهُۥ","en":"Then He eased the way for him;","w":[{"ar":"ثُمَّ","tr":"thumma","en":"Then"},{"ar":"ٱلسَّبِيلَ","tr":"l-sabīla","en":"the way","root":"سبل","lem":"سَبِيل"},{"ar":"يَسَّرَهُۥ","tr":"yassarahu","en":"He made easy for him","root":"يسر","lem":"يَسَّرَ"}]},{"n":21,"juz":30,"ar":"ثُمَّ أَمَاتَهُۥ فَأَقْبَرَهُۥ","en":"Then He causes his death and provides a grave for him.","w":[{"ar":"ثُمَّ","tr":"thumma","en":"Then"},{"ar":"أَمَاتَهُۥ","tr":"amātahu","en":"He causes him to die","root":"موت","lem":"أَماتَ"},{"ar":"فَأَقْبَرَهُۥ","tr":"fa-aqbarahu","en":"and provides a grave for him","root":"قبر","lem":"أَقْبَرَ"}]},{"n":22,"juz":30,"ar":"ثُمَّ إِذَا شَآءَ أَنشَرَهُۥ","en":"Then when He wills, He will resurrect him.","w":[{"ar":"ثُمَّ","tr":"thumma","en":"Then"},{"ar":"إِذَا","tr":"idhā","en":"when"},{"ar":"شَآءَ","tr":"shāa","en":"He wills","root":"شيأ","lem":"شاءَ"},{"ar":"أَنشَرَهُۥ","tr":"ansharahu","en":"He will resurrect him","root":"نشر","lem":"أَنشَرَ"}]},{"n":23,"juz":30,"ar":"كَلَّا لَمَّا يَقْضِ مَآ أَمَرَهُۥ","en":"No! He [i.e., man] has not yet accomplished what He commanded him.","w":[{"ar":"كَلَّا","tr":"kallā","en":"Nay"},{"ar":"لَمَّا","tr":"lammā","en":"Not"},{"ar":"يَقْضِ","tr":"yaqḍi","en":"he has accomplished","root":"قضي","lem":"قَضَى"},{"ar":"مَآ","tr":"mā","en":"what"},{"ar":"أَمَرَهُۥ","tr":"amarahu","en":"He commanded him","root":"أمر","lem":"أَمَرَ"}]},{"n":24,"juz":30,"ar":"فَلْيَنظُرِ ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ إِلَىٰ طَعَامِهِۦٓ","en":"Then let mankind look at his food -","w":[{"ar":"فَلْيَنظُرِ","tr":"falyanẓuri","en":"Then let look","root":"نظر","lem":"نَظَرَ"},{"ar":"ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ","tr":"l-insānu","en":"the man","root":"أنس","lem":"إِنسان"},{"ar":"إِلَىٰ","tr":"ilā","en":"at"},{"ar":"طَعَامِهِۦٓ","tr":"ṭaʿāmihi","en":"his food","root":"طعم","lem":"طَعام"}]},{"n":25,"juz":30,"ar":"أَنَّا صَبَبْنَا ٱلْمَآءَ صَبًّا","en":"How We poured down water in torrents,","w":[{"ar":"اَنَّا","tr":"annā","en":"That [We]"},{"ar":"صَبَبْنَا","tr":"ṣababnā","en":"[We] poured","root":"صبب","lem":"صَبَّ"},{"ar":"ٱلْمَآءَ","tr":"l-māa","en":"the water","root":"موه","lem":"ماء"},{"ar":"صَبًّۭا","tr":"ṣabban","en":"(in) abundance","root":"صبب","lem":"صَبّ"}]},{"n":26,"juz":30,"ar":"ثُمَّ شَقَقْنَا ٱلْأَرْضَ شَقًّا","en":"Then We broke open the earth, splitting [it with sprouts],","w":[{"ar":"ثُمَّ","tr":"thumma","en":"Then"},{"ar":"شَقَقْنَا","tr":"shaqaqnā","en":"We cleaved","root":"شقق","lem":"شَقَقْ"},{"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضَ","tr":"l-arḍa","en":"the earth","root":"أرض","lem":"أَرْض"},{"ar":"شَقًّۭا","tr":"shaqqan","en":"splitting","root":"شقق","lem":"شَقّ"}]},{"n":27,"juz":30,"ar":"فَأَنۢبَتْنَا فِيهَا حَبًّا","en":"And caused to grow within it grain","w":[{"ar":"فَأَنۢبَتْنَا","tr":"fa-anbatnā","en":"Then We caused to grow","root":"نبت","lem":"أَنۢبَتَ"},{"ar":"فِيهَا","tr":"fīhā","en":"therein"},{"ar":"حَبًّۭا","tr":"ḥabban","en":"grain","root":"حبب","lem":"حَبّ"}]},{"n":28,"juz":30,"ar":"وَعِنَبًا وَقَضْبًا","en":"And grapes and herbage","w":[{"ar":"وَعِنَبًۭا","tr":"waʿinaban","en":"And grapes","root":"عنب","lem":"عِنَب"},{"ar":"وَقَضْبًۭا","tr":"waqaḍban","en":"and green fodder","root":"قضب","lem":"قَضْب"}]},{"n":29,"juz":30,"ar":"وَزَيْتُونًا وَنَخْلًا","en":"And olive and palm trees","w":[{"ar":"وَزَيْتُونًۭا","tr":"wazaytūnan","en":"And olive","root":"زيت","lem":"زَيْتُون"},{"ar":"وَنَخْلًۭا","tr":"wanakhlan","en":"and date-palms","root":"نخل","lem":"نَخْل"}]},{"n":30,"juz":30,"ar":"وَحَدَآئِقَ غُلْبًا","en":"And gardens of dense shrubbery","w":[{"ar":"وَحَدَآئِقَ","tr":"waḥadāiqa","en":"And gardens","root":"حدق","lem":"حَدائِق"},{"ar":"غُلْبًۭا","tr":"ghul'ban","en":"(of) thick foliage","root":"غلب","lem":"غُلْب"}]},{"n":31,"juz":30,"ar":"وَفَـٰك