ry man, that Day, will be a matter adequate for him.","w":[{"ar":"لِكُلِّ","tr":"likulli","en":"For every","root":"كلل","lem":"كُلّ"},{"ar":"ٱمْرِئٍۢ","tr":"im'ri-in","en":"man","root":"مرأ","lem":"امْرِئ"},{"ar":"مِّنْهُمْ","tr":"min'hum","en":"among them"},{"ar":"يَوْمَئِذٍۢ","tr":"yawma-idhin","en":"that Day","root":"يوم","lem":"يَوْم"},{"ar":"شَأْنٌۭ","tr":"shanun","en":"(will be) a matter","root":"شأن","lem":"شَأْن"},{"ar":"يُغْنِيهِ","tr":"yugh'nīhi","en":"occupying him","root":"غني","lem":"أَغْنَتْ"}]},{"n":38,"juz":30,"ar":"وُجُوهٌ يَوْمَئِذٍ مُّسْفِرَةٌ","en":"[Some] faces, that Day, will be bright -","w":[{"ar":"وُجُوهٌۭ","tr":"wujūhun","en":"Faces","root":"وجه","lem":"وَجْه"},{"ar":"يَوْمَئِذٍۢ","tr":"yawma-idhin","en":"that Day","root":"يوم","lem":"يَوْم"},{"ar":"مُّسْفِرَةٌۭ","tr":"mus'firatun","en":"(will be) bright","root":"سفر","lem":"مُسْفِرَة"}]},{"n":39,"juz":30,"ar":"ضَاحِكَةٌ مُّسْتَبْشِرَةٌ","en":"Laughing, rejoicing at good news.","w":[{"ar":"ضَاحِكَةٌۭ","tr":"ḍāḥikatun","en":"Laughing","root":"ضحك","lem":"ضاحِكَة"},{"ar":"مُّسْتَبْشِرَةٌۭ","tr":"mus'tabshiratun","en":"rejoicing at good news","root":"بشر","lem":"مُسْتَبْشِرَة"}]},{"n":40,"juz":30,"ar":"وَوُجُوهٌ يَوْمَئِذٍ عَلَيْهَا غَبَرَةٌ","en":"And [other] faces, that Day, will have upon them dust.","w":[{"ar":"وَوُجُوهٌۭ","tr":"wawujūhun","en":"And faces","root":"وجه","lem":"وَجْه"},{"ar":"يَوْمَئِذٍ","tr":"yawma-idhin","en":"that Day","root":"يوم","lem":"يَوْم"},{"ar":"عَلَيْهَا","tr":"ʿalayhā","en":"upon them"},{"ar":"غَبَرَةٌۭ","tr":"ghabaratun","en":"(will be) dust","root":"غبر","lem":"غَبَرَة"}]},{"n":41,"juz":30,"ar":"تَرْهَقُهَا قَتَرَةٌ","en":"Blackness will cover them.","w":[{"ar":"تَرْهَقُهَا","tr":"tarhaquhā","en":"Will cover them","root":"رهق","lem":"يَرْهَقُ"},{"ar":"قَتَرَةٌ","tr":"qataratun","en":"darkness","root":"قتر","lem":"قَتَرَة"}]},{"n":42,"juz":30,"ar":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ هُمُ ٱلْكَفَرَةُ ٱلْفَجَرَةُ","en":"Those are the disbelievers, the wicked ones.","w":[{"ar":"أُو۟لَ